<% var pageTitle='الكلاسات'; var days=['الأحد','الاثنين','الثلاثاء','الأربعاء','الخميس','الجمعة','السبت']; %>
<%- include('_layout_top') %>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4">جدول الكلاسات</h1>
  <% if (saved) { %><div class="bg-emerald-900/40 border border-emerald-700 text-emerald-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 mb-4 text-sm">تم الحفظ ✅</div><% } %>
  <div class="card rounded-2xl p-4 mb-5">
    <form method="POST" action="/gym/classes/add" class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
      <input name="name" required placeholder="اسم الكلاس (كروس فيت)" class="fld rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm" />
      <select name="day_of_week" class="fld rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm"><% days.forEach(function(d,i){ %><option value="<%= i %>"><%= d %></option><% }); %></select>
      <input name="start_time" placeholder="الوقت (18:00)" dir="ltr" class="fld rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm" />
      <input name="duration_min" type="number" min="1" value="60" placeholder="المدة (دقيقة)" class="fld rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm" />
      <input name="capacity" type="number" min="1" value="20" placeholder="السعة" class="fld rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm" />
      <select name="trainer_id" class="fld rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm"><option value="">— المدرّب —</option><% trainers.forEach(function(t){ %><option value="<%= t.id %>"><%= t.name %></option><% }); %></select>
      <button class="accent-bg font-bold rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm sm:col-span-3">+ إضافة كلاس</button>
    </form>
  </div>
  <% if (!classes.length) { %><p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 text-center py-6">مفيش كلاسات.</p><% } else { %>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <% classes.forEach(function(c){ %>
      <div class="card rounded-xl px-4 py-3 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="font-bold text-sm flex-1"><%= c.name %></span>
        <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400"><%= days[c.day_of_week]||'' %> · <%= c.start_time||'' %><%= c.trainer_name?(' · '+c.trainer_name):'' %></span>
        <span class="text-xs text-neutral-600">سعة <%= c.capacity %></span>
        <form method="POST" action="/gym/classes/<%= c.id %>/delete" onsubmit="return confirm('حذف؟')"><button class="bg-red-600 text-white text-xs rounded-full w-6 h-6">×</button></form>
      </div>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  <% } %>
<%- include('_layout_bottom') %>
